iversity. Preferred Qualifications • Previous experience teaching at the collegiate level. • Willingness to be flexible in class scheduling. Physical Requirements and/or Unusual Work Hours Special Instructions to Applicant This is a pooled position from which Adjunct Instructors will be selected when/if a need arises in the department. Should review of your qualifications result in a decision to pursue your candidacy, you will be contacted directly. These pools are closed down annually during the summer and you will receive notification that a refreshed application is needed for you to continue to be considered. La Salle University embraces diversity and seeks candidates who will contribute to a climate that supports a fully inclusive, equitable, and diverse working and learning environment. We strongly encourage individuals from underrepresented and/or marginalized identities to apply . HR/Comp Compensation Information Position Classification Part-Time, Semesterly Basis FLSA Classification Exempt Pay Basis Salary Position Group Faculty Posting Information Application Open Date 10/27/2022 Application Close Date Application Open To Internal and External Applicants Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Interest Resume/Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Statement of Teaching Philosophy Teaching Evaluations Transcript(s) Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Do you have a Master's degree in psychology or a closely related field? Yes No Return to Top 1900 W. Olney Avenue, Philadelphia, PA 19141 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
