    "https://lasalle.peopleadmin.com/postings/4915": {
      "title": "La Salle University Job Applicant Site",
      "description": "La Salle University Applicant Site | Adjunct Faculty, Undergraduate Nursing Clinical Skip to Main Content La Salle University Job Applicant Site Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Announcements Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQs La Salle Website La Salle Human Resources Annual Security Report Adjunct Faculty, Undergraduate Nursing Clinical Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. This is a pooled position from which Adjunct Instructors will be selected when/if a need arises in the department. Should review of your qualifications result in a decision to pursue your candidacy, you will be contacted directly. These pools are closed down annually during the summer and you will receive notification that a refreshed application is needed for you to continue to be considered. La Salle University embraces diversity and seeks candidates who will contribute to a climate that supports a fully inclusive, equitable, and diverse working and learning environment. We strongly encourage individuals from underrepresented and/or marginalized identities to apply . Position Details Position Overview Position Title Adjunct Faculty, Undergraduate Nursing Clinical Department 231100 - Nursing Undergraduate Position Description/Posting Details Posting Number A0046P Position Summary La Salle University’s School of Nursing and Health Sciences has an ongoing need for highly qualified clinical adjunct faculty to teach a variety of courses each semester on an “as needed” basis. Essential Duties • Teach assigned course(s) at a clinical site. • Administer clinical materials consistent with departmental learning objectives. • Provide feedback and support to students. Required Qualifications • BSN . • Knowledge and commitment to the mission of La Salle University. Preferred Qualifications • At least currently enrolled in an MSN program or Doctoral program. Physical Requirements and/or Unusual Work Hours • Clinical may be offered in the evenings or weekends. Special Instructions to Applicant This is a pooled position from which Adjunct Instructors will be selected when/if a need arises in the department. Should review of your qualifications result in a decision to pursue your candidacy, you will be contacted directly. These pools are closed down annually during the summer and you will receive notification that a refreshed application is needed for you to continue to be considered. La Salle University embraces diversity and seeks candidates who will contribute to a climate that supports a fully inclusive, equitable, and diverse working and learning environment. We strongly encourage individuals from underrepresented and/or marginalized identities to apply . HR/Comp Compensation Information Position Classification Part-Time, Semesterly Basis FLSA Classification Exempt Pay Basis Salary Position Group Faculty Posting Information Application Open Date 10/10/2022 Application Close Date Application Open To Internal and External Applicants Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Interest Resume/Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * What is the highest level of education you have completed (at the time of application)? GED High School Diploma Associates Degree Bachelor's Degree Master's Degree Doctorate Degree (e.g., PhD, PsyD, JD) None of the above Return to Top 1900 W. Olney Avenue, Philadelphia, PA 19141 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
